Hades is a god of death out of the film made by the [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/Arcane Intelligence|arcane intelligence]], one of three villains chosen to recover the stolen mirror. He has blue fire for hair and a sharp tongue, claims to be immortal, and rules an underworld, raising the dead to serve him as thralls. Sailing from [[Geography/Afro-China|Afro-China]], he looked up past the sky of the film and saw an enormous cat hanging from a branch, with the words "The Titans will be remembered" beneath it, in ancient Greek. He came out of the film through the [[Phenomena/Enchanted Mirror|enchanted mirror]] with the others, and walks the real world.
